TI  - Influence of mental health on information seeking, risk perception and mask wearing self-efficacy during the early months of the COVID-19 pandemic: a longitudinal panel study across 6 U.S. States
AU  - Courtney Welton‐Mitchell
AU  - Miranda Dally
AU  - Katherine L. Dickinson
